<title>NEW ZEALAND: RALLYING-NEW ZEALAND RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-NEW ZEALAND RALLY LEADING POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after the first</p>
<p>leg (10 stages completed of rally total of 24) of the New</p>
<p>Zealand rally on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford one hour 26 minutes and 14 seconds</p>
<p>2. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru 1:26.36</p>
<p>3. Juha Kankkunen (Finland) Ford 1:27.26</p>
<p>4. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitsubishi 1:28.23</p>
<p>5. Possum Bourne (New Zealand) Subaru 1:29.17</p>
<p>6. Neal Bates (Australia) Toyota 1:31.06</p>
<p>7. Gustavo Trelles (Uruguay) Mitsubishi 1:33.07</p>
<p>8. Joe McAndrew (New Zealand) Subaru 1:33.41</p>
<p>9. Brian Stokes (New Zealand) Ford 1:33.44</p>
<p>10. Reece Jones (New Zealand) Mitsubishi 1:34.15</p>
<p>The second leg begins on Monday, Aug 4, at 0600 (local NZ</p>
<p>time) and includes eight stages.</p>
</text>
